ult":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-25T23:23:05Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T03:24:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- reproducible in v4.2.dev4 and all newer versions (including newest v4.8-dev2).\n- not reproducible in v4.2.dev3 and older versions.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev2 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 6 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 6950 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21030.2001) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 63.92 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIssue tested with `TextureRect`-Images\n- with `display/window/stretch/mode` set to `cavas_items` or `viewport`\n\nThe Image is scaling in opposite/wrong directions, probably an issue with some inverted values on scale calculations?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. create a clean new project in any version since Godot v4.2.dev4 and above\n2. set `display/window/stretch/mode` to `cavas_items` or `viewport` in project settings\n3. add a `TextureRect` to the scene, save the scene and play this scene.\n4. change the window size by dragging the window-borders to any direction\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug-test-#2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30380380/bug-test-.2.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/